title: Economic Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: economic_policy_timer += 12; month_actions += 1; nationalize_budget = 4; nationalize_budget -= 1 if works_councils >= 2; nationalize_budget -= 1 if works_councils >= 3; nationalize_budget -= 1 if socializations + nationalization_progress + nationalized_housing >= 2; wtb_budget = 4; wtb_budget -= 1 if works_councils >= 2 or socializations >= 1 or pro_labor >= 2
view-if: linke_in_government = 1 and (economic_minister_party == "LINKE" or finance_minister_party == "LINKE") and economic_policy_timer <= 0
card-image: img/portraits/SchmidtRobert.jpg
go-to: economic_plan_menu
#subtitle: Policies to address the economic crisis.

= Economic Policy

We have already formulated an economic plan. Now we have to implement it. [? if budget < 0: If our budget falls too far into the red, a capital strike will almost certainly be triggered. ?]


@economic_plan_menu

- @wtb_2
- @nationalize_1
- @green_energy
- @root: Do not implement the economic plan.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action


@wtb_2
title: public works program for economic growth
subtitle: -[+ wtb_budget +] budget
unavailable-subtitle: Unemployment is low enough that the time for the WTB-Plan has passed.
view-if: budget >= wtb_budget
choose-if: (unemployed > 5 or economic_growth < 1) and pragmatist_strength >= 40
on-arrival: wtb_enactment_2_finish = time + 10; works_program += 1; budget -= wtb_budget; urban_linke += 5*(1-dissent); urban += 1 if works_program <= 4; east_linke += 5*(1-dissent); wtb_implemented += 1; inflation += 0.9; economic_growth += 1.2; economic_growth += (db_rail+housing_built)/8; pro_status_quo += 4; urban_afd -= 2; spd_coalition_dissent -= 1; greens_coalition_dissent -= 1; spd_relation += 3; greens_relation += 2; oldleft_dissent += 3; beweli_dissent += 4; pragmatist_dissent -= 1;

[? if works_program == 4 : We have commenced Phase 2 of the WTB-Plan. ?][? if works_program > 4 :  We have continued our implementation of the WTB-Plan. ?] In addition to public works, we are now focusing on rebuilding our industries.

####################### left economic policies (socializations)

@nationalize_1
title: Implement the Left plan for the transformation of the economy.
subtitle: -[+ nationalize_budget +] budget. [? if works_councils >= 3 : Our works councils have reduced the budget necessary for this program. ?] [? if socializations >= 2: Our existing socialization policies have reduced the budget necessary for this program. ?]
unavailable-subtitle: pragmatists/budget
choose-if: econ_moderation < 7 and budget >= nationalize_budget
on-arrival: nationalization_progress += 1; capital_strike_progress += 2; unemployed -= 3.5 if unemployed >= 6; unemployed -= 1.2 if works_councils >= 3; urban += 2 if nationalization_progress < 2; budget -= nationalize_budget; works_program += 1; urban_linke += 6*(1-dissent); east_linke += 5*(1-dissent); spd_coalition_dissent += 1; greens_coalition_dissent += 0.5; spd_relation -= 4; greens_relation -= 2; oldleft_dissent -= 5; beweli_dissent -= 5; pragmatist_dissent += 4; upper_linke -= 3; inflation += 2; fdp_relation -= 2; cdu_relation -= 2; economic_growth += 1.7 if economic_growth < 5;

@green_energy
title: green energy invest
subtitle: -1 budget
view-if: social_moderation < 9
unavailable_subtitle: not enough money
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: green_energy_econ += 1; greens_relation += 4; greens_coalition_dissent -= 0.5; capital_strike_progress += 0.5; economic_growth += 0.4; budget -= 1; youth_linke += issue_environment*(1-dissent); issue_environment -= 0.5; fdp_relation -= 1; cdu_relation -= 1;
